properties for homebuyers and commercial property buyers.","Investment holding: engages in investment holding and property investment and management services.","Complementary business: provides civil and mechanical engineering, maintenance, and utility services, as well as management and construction services.","Engineering and trading: undertakes electrical works, trading of construction materials, and rental of plant and machinery.","Sales and marketing: provides sales and marketing services for property development."]}}